dlazyai/dlazy-banana2  1.0.0 -> 1.0.1
change_type: instructions+docs   changelog: - Added an "Authentication" section with detailed steps for obtaining and setting the dLazy API key via the CLI. - Clarified that all requests require API key configuration. - No changes made to command options, example usage, or error handling. - Documentation updated in SKILL.md, SKILL-en.md, and SKILL-cn.md for improved onboarding and clarity.

### SKILL-cn.md  [docs]
- version: 1.0.0
+ version: 1.0.1
+ ## 身份验证 (Authentication)
+ 所有请求都需要配置 dLazy API key。
+ **CLI 配置**: 你可以通过以下命令设置你的 API key：
+ ```bash
+ dlazy auth set YOUR_API_KEY
+ ```
+ ### 获取你的 API Key
+ 1. 登录或在 [dlazy.com](https://dlazy.com) 创建账号
+ 2. 访问 [dlazy.com/dashboard/organization/api-key](https://dlazy.com/dashboard/organization/api-key)
+ 3. 点击 API Key 右侧的复制按钮获取它

### SKILL-en.md  [docs]
- version: 1.0.0
+ version: 1.0.1
+ ## Authentication
+ All requests require the dLazy API key via CLI configuration.
+ **CLI Configuration**: You can set your API key using the following command:
+ ```bash
+ dlazy auth set YOUR_API_KEY
+ ```
+ ### Getting Your API Key
+ 1. Sign in or create an account at [dlazy.com](https://dlazy.com)
+ 2. Go to [dlazy.com/dashboard/organization/api-key](https://dlazy.com/dashboard/organization/api-key)
+ 3. Click the copy button on the right side of API Key section to copy it

